@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11
|Purchasing Employee|
start
:View products below minimum stock;
:Select product to reorder;
:Enter desired quantity;
|System|
:Show linked manufacturers ordered by purchase price;
|Purchasing Employee|
:Contact cheapest manufacturer;
while (Can manufacturer supply the medicine?) is ([no])
  :Contact next cheapest manufacturer;
  if (No manufacturers remain?) then ([yes])
    :Remove product from internal reorder list;
    stop
  endif
endwhile ([yes])
:Confirm purchase with manufacturer;
|System|
:Register confirmed purchase order;
:Show confirmation;
stop
@enduml
